 Jehovah was not able to bring this people into the land which He swore to give them, He has therefore slaughtered them in the wilderness.","tok":[{"t":"Because "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"not","s":["H1115"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"able","s":["H3201"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[5]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[8]},{"t":" which He "},{"t":"swore","s":["H7650"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to give them, He has therefore slaughtered them in the "},{"t":"wilderness","s":["H4057"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"And now, I pray, let the power of the Lord be great, just as You have spoken, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And now, I pray, let the "},{"t":"power","s":["H3581"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[4]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"great","s":["H1431"],"a":[1]},{"t":", just as You have "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":","}]},{"n":18,"text":"Jehovah is slow to anger and abundant in lovingkindness, forgiving iniquity and transgression; but He will by no means clear the guilty, visiting the iniquity of the fathers upon the children to the third and the fourth generations.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is slow to anger and abundant in lovingkindness, "},{"t":"forgiving","s":["H5375"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"transgression","s":["H6588"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; but He will by no "},{"t":"means","s":["H5352"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"clear","s":["H5352"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the guilty, "},{"t":"visiting","s":["H6485"],"a":[11]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[13]},{"t":" upon the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"third","s":["H8029"],"a":[17]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"fourth","s":["H7256"],"a":[19]},{"t":" generati